  <entry>
    <title>200W Inverter Design</title>
    <link href="/2025/09/11/200W%20Inverter%20Design/"/>
    <url>/2025/09/11/200W%20Inverter%20Design/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>设计功率：<spanclass="math inline"><em>P</em> = 500<em>W</em></span></p><p>交流电周期：<spanclass="math inline"><em>T</em> = 50<em>H</em><em>z</em></span></p><p>效率：<span class="math inline"><em>η</em> = 90%</span></p><p>输入电压：<spanclass="math inline"><em>U</em><sub><em>d</em><em>c</em></sub> = 48<em>V</em></span></p><p>输出电压有效值：<spanclass="math inline"><em>U</em><sub><em>a</em><em>c</em></sub> = 24<em>V</em></span></p><p>输入电流：<span class="math inline">$I_{in} = \frac{P}{U_{dc}/η} =3.75A$</span></p><p>输出电流有效值：<span class="math inline">$I_{o} = \frac{P}{U_{ac}} =8.33A$</span></p><p>输入等效电阻：<span class="math inline">$R_{dc} = \frac{U_{dc}^2}{P /η} = \frac{48^2}{200 / 0.9} = 10.37Ω$</span></p><p>输出等效电阻：<span class="math inline">$R_{ac} = \frac{U_{ac}^2}{P}= \frac{48^2}{200} = 11.52Ω$</span></p><p>输入电容：<span class="math inline">$C_{dc} = \frac{(6 \sim8)T}{2R_{dc}} = \frac{(6 \sim 8)\times0.02}{2 \times 10.37} = 5787 \sim7716 μF$</span></p><p>开关管承受最大电压：<spanclass="math inline"><em>U</em><sub><em>m</em><em>o</em><em>s</em><sub><em>m</em><em>a</em><em>x</em></sub></sub> = <em>U</em><sub><em>d</em><em>c</em></sub> = 48<em>V</em></span></p><p>开关管承受最大电流：<span class="math inline">$I_{mos_{max}} =\frac{\sqrt{2} \times P}{U_{ac}} = \frac{\sqrt{2} \times 200}{24} =11.79A$</span></p><p>允许最大脉动电流：<spanclass="math inline"><em>Δ</em><em>I</em><sub><em>m</em><em>a</em><em>x</em></sub> = 20% × <em>I</em><sub><em>o</em></sub> = 20% × 8.33 = 1.67<em>A</em></span></p>]]></content>
    
    
    <categories>
      
      <category>Electronic technology</category>
      
    </categories>
    
    
